","description":{"zh":"更有层次感、更华丽的小冠，多为朝中有能之士佩戴。","en":"A more layered and ornate small crown, worn by capable officials at court."},"mp":"700","evade":"6","price":"3900","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10146","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1030915","code":"100"}]},"otherRelationship":{"label":{"zh":"其他关系","en":"Other relationships"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10952","code":"6"},{"id":"WJ10173","code":"6"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI107015","name":{"zh":"会稽朱氏","en":"The Zhu clan of Kuaiji"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自曹姓，邾子之后，去邑为朱氏。东汉光武帝时，因党锢之祸避居会稽，遂成望族。会稽郡早期士族之一。朱儁为东汉太尉，率军镇压黄巾、讨伐董卓，官至骠骑将军，封钱塘侯，为汉末名将。其家族在会稽根基深厚，为江东早期重要政治力量。","en":"Descended from the Cao surname as heirs to the rulers of Zhu, they adopted the surname Zhu by dropping the city radical. During the Eastern Han under Emperor Guangwu, they fled to Kuaiji due to the Disaster of the Partisan Prohibitions and became a distinguished clan, standing as one of Kuaiji Commandery's earliest prominent gentry families. Zhu Jun served as Grand Commandant of the Eastern Han, leading forces to suppress the Yellow Turbans and campaign against Dong Zhuo. Rising to General of Agile Cavalry and enfeoffed as the Marquis of Qiantang, he was a renowned commander of the late Han. Deeply rooted in Kuaiji, his Family became a vital political force in early Jiangdong."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"6","politics":"5"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"朱皓","height":"较矮","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10072","city":"CS1017","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[58,57,64,59,76,68],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0